# aml-s905d3-cc_libre_resident_defconfig with the SC heartbeat opted in: PREBOOT
# copies the control FDT to ${fdt_addr_r}, sets /soc/sc-heartbeat@fffe7200
# "okay" in the copy, and points fdt_addr at it (the EFI path prefers fdt_addr
# over fdtcontroladdr).  The control FDT is never edited: an in-place edit
# shifts node offsets under the driver model (no live tree), and a device
# probed later reads a stale node (meson-rng: readl(~0) at EFI boot).  Pairs
# with an SC built SCP_G12A_AP_HEARTBEAT=ON.  Generated by savedefconfig.
# LBS target aml-s905d3-cc-libre-resident-hb.
# Plan: claude amlogic/software/boot/g12/plan/sm1-two-stage-watchdog.md "Landing".
